          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa ore to losho le Asheri, neishori Mishal te nebo iwuejitin enyena neeirritishoreki, Abdon te nebo iwuejitin enyena neeirritishoreki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helkat te nebo iwuejitin enyena neeirritishoreki, o Rehob te nebo iwuejitin enyena neeirritishoreki - nkanas ong'uan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa ore to losho le Naftali, neishori Kedesh te Galilaya te nebo iwuejitin enyena neeirritishoreki, ina anasa e sarunoto te ilo otasesekuanishe, Hamot-dor te nebo iwuejitin enyena neeirritishoreki, o Kartan te nebo iwuejitin enyena neeirritishoreki - nkanas uni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa nkanas oo lmareita loo le Gershon naa tomon o okuni pooki te nebo iwuejitin enye neeirritishoreki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.33",
