          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore to losho le Gad, neishori Ramot te Gilead te nebo iwuejitin enyena neeirritishoreki, ina anasa e sarunoto te ilo otasesekuanishe, Mahanaim te nebo iwuejitin enyena neeirritishoreki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heshbon te nebo iwuejitin enyena neeirritishoreki, Yasar te nebo iwuejitin enyena neeirritishoreki - nkanas ong'uan te umata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ti alo nkanas oo lmareita loo Lmerari, aa taa lelo ootelekutua too lmareita le Lawi, nena apa naatoorikiaki ninche, naa nkanas tomon o are pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.40"
            ]
          }
        }
