              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eishoo Olaitoriani Israel ina kop pooki apa nainosie ninye olmumai nchere keisho loo menye; ore ake eibung ina kop, nemany ninche ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisho ninche Olaitoriani enkiyeng'iyeng te pooki shoto anaa apa enainosa ninye olmumai too loo menye; meetae hoo ninye obo loo lmang'ati lenye oidima aitasheikinore ninche, amu eishooyie apa Olaitoriani ilmang'ati lenye pooki apik atua nkaik enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meetae hoo enkisiligata nabo e nena kisiligat apa sidain naaisiligie Olaitoriani enkaji e Israel neitu ebaya; etabaitie pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.45"
            ]
          }
        }
